    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/5483ca8d3224d258dceb786433d9fb34.poster.avif?t=1750991629\" width=600 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/5483ca8d3224d258dceb786433d9fb34.webm?t=1750991629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/5483ca8d3224d258dceb786433d9fb34.mp4?t=1750991629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>An adventurer from an alien planet accidentally lands on the continent of Volant, and so begins the Philna Fantasy.<br>Explore the world through battles and puzzle solving, choose the right equipment and skills to build your character, and finally face the shadows invading the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/6c4bd217ba3333d5a8b6b62df1456f9d.poster.avif?t=1750991629\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/6c4bd217ba3333d5a8b6b62df1456f9d.webm?t=1750991629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/6c4bd217ba3333d5a8b6b62df1456f9d.mp4?t=1750991629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore every part of Volant, fight monsters in different dungeons, and acquire equipment of higher quality and richer effects!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/506b9349af4512d1daf93104cfdb2e4f.poster.avif?t=1750991629\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/506b9349af4512d1daf93104cfdb2e4f.webm?t=1750991629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/506b9349af4512d1daf93104cfdb2e4f.mp4?t=1750991629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Solve the puzzles hidden in Volant, open the doors that no one has ever passed through, and get the treasure that's been waiting for you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/33c33fe787c37ae418074f3940e9f4a0.poster.avif?t=1750991629\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/33c33fe787c37ae418074f3940e9f4a0.webm?t=1750991629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/33c33fe787c37ae418074f3940e9f4a0.mp4?t=1750991629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Use the materials collected on your journey to forge weapons, craft equipment, refine medicines, and create gems. All materials can be turned into treasures!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/e5e48963a2c151c10c564c54ed0ab229.poster.avif?t=1750991629\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/e5e48963a2c151c10c564c54ed0ab229.webm?t=1750991629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/e5e48963a2c151c10c564c54ed0ab229.mp4?t=1750991629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Adventurers are trusted by the residents of Volant. Solve their problems and get paid handsomely!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2>Collections: Magic Cards, Treasure Chests, Antiques...... In the continent of Volant, you can always get unexpected rewards to make your adventure life richer!<br>Pet: Every adventurer should have a little pet. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/b58bc1601d85d0e1ca25d258e034c269.poster.avif?t=1750991629\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/b58bc1601d85d0e1ca25d258e034c269.webm?t=1750991629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/b58bc1601d85d0e1ca25d258e034c269.mp4?t=1750991629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
